for(k in 1:2)local({j<-k;ss<-c('Higher','Lower')[j];d<-em[set==ss];id<-paste0('FigS12',LETTERS[j]);title<-paste('Primary EXON:',tolower(ss));register(id,d,d,function(){txt<-sprintf('%d associated genes; %d mapped proteins\n%s',d$query_genes,d$query_proteins,if(d$query_proteins<2)'Enrichment not tested: insufficient mapping'else'No prespecified category passed adjusted P < 0.05');ggplot()+annotate('text',x=0,y=0,label=txt,family='Arial',size=FS/ggplot2::.pt)+labs(title=title)+theme_void(base_family='Arial',base_size=FS)+theme(plot.title=element_text(size=FS,face='bold'))},'Primary EXON direction-specific mapping and enrichment status. Higher11 genes had0 mapped proteins and were not tested; lower349 genes mapped226 proteins and had no corrected terms in the four prespecified categories. Insufficient mapping is not evidence of absent biology.','主EXON分方向映射和富集状态：较高11基因无映射蛋白，未检验；较低349基因映射226蛋白，四个预定类别无校正条目。映射不足不是缺乏生物学功能的证据。');participant_overrides[[id]]<<-m[complete_primary==TRUE,.(sample_id)]})
short_axis<-function(v){dict<-c(setNames(c('HC','AD','Other'),G3),Positive_vs_HC='AD vs HC',Negative_vs_HC='Other vs HC',Positive_vs_Negative='AD vs Other',A_CBC='Blood cells',A_detection10='Detection 10%',A_detection30='Detection 30%',A_primary='Primary',A_unshared='Unshared');ifelse(v%in%names(dict),unname(dict[v]),v)}
for(id in names(registry)[grepl('^FigS',names(registry))])local({ii<-id;fn<-registry[[ii]];registry[[ii]]<<-function(){p<-fn();xn<-rlang::as_label(p$mapping$x);if(xn%in%c('g','pathology_group','population','contrast','model'))p<-p+scale_x_discrete(labels=short_axis);if(ii=='FigS7A')p<-p+guides(colour=guide_legend(ncol=2));p}})
